    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/quickstrap/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "QuickStrap is a free Bootstrap 5 WordPress starter theme for developers and bloggers who want Bootstrap's clean look without a build step. It ships Bootstrap 5.3.8 plus one small theme stylesheet: no JavaScript, no jQuery, no npm or Sass, no web fonts. Activate it and write, or build on it with a child theme. The templates use Bootstrap's own markup (navbar, grid, pagination, input group, form controls, buttons), the main menu has dropdown sub-menus that work without JavaScript, and ten action hooks let a child theme add code anywhere. One, two or three columns in three sidebar layouts, light or dark top bar, centred or full-width page, automatic dark mode, header and accent colour pickers, Bootstrap cards, alerts, outline buttons and patterns in the block editor, optional Bootstrap JavaScript and Bootstrap Icons, footer widgets, a full width template and print styles. Uses the familiar Widgets and Menus screens and works with the block editor."
    },
